N1  - <p>BOINC criterion evidence - Abstract, verbatim: "This paper describes initial work in the development of the DNA@Home volunteer computing project, which aims to use Gibbs sampling for the identification and location of DNA control signals on full genome scale data sets." Also verbatim: "volunteer computing can provide the necessary computational power to make full genome analysis feasible." | Full text: Springer LNCS 144, DOI 10.1007/978-3-642-28314-7_52 | Link: DNA@Home / BOINC | Source: ICCACS 2011/2012ER&nbsp;&nbsp;-</p>
